# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied to dist/ verbatim by scripts/build.mjs.
#
# A redirect here is not a second copy of a page. It is the opposite: it exists
# so that a URL published somewhere this repo cannot reach keeps resolving to
# the one page that does exist. Anything that would need its own content is a
# page under site/pages/, not a line in this file.

# Shutoku's legal pages were briefly published at the top level, and
# /shutoku/account-deletion is the URL named in the app's Play Data safety
# form. The pages live under /tools/shutoku/ with the rest of the tool, so
# these two paths point at them rather than duplicating them. Update the Play
# form to the /tools/shutoku/ URL and these can be deleted.
/shutoku/privacy           /tools/shutoku/privacy/           301
/shutoku/account-deletion  /tools/shutoku/account-deletion/  301
/shutoku/*                 /tools/shutoku/:splat             301
